CP(1)

NAME
     cp - copy files

SYNOPSIS
     cp from to
     cp file ... directory

DESCRIPTION
     Makes a copy of a file under a new name, or copies one or more
     files into a directory. The original is left as it was. If the
     destination already exists, it is replaced.

EXAMPLES
     cp ledger /tmp/ledger.copy

SEE ALSO
     mv(1), rm(1)
